# Metrics layer

`src/client/metrics` is an adapter, like `src/client/decks` and `src/client/networking`.

- Never import it from `src/server`.
- Never call `reduce()` / `advance()` from the collector.
- Persist with IndexedDB (localStorage fallback); write after every observation.
- Wall-clock (`Date.now`) is allowed here; it is forbidden in the engine.
- Ids via nanoid at this boundary only.
- Incomplete rules questions go to `docs/OPEN_DESIGN.md`, not approximated in charts.
